# Normalise to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# Not cosmetic: docs/ is uploaded to Cloudflare Pages verbatim, so a CRLF
# working copy deploys bytes a clone does not produce, and "the served files
# match the committed ones" stops being checkable. Outcrop shipped exactly
# that on 2026-09-19 and it took reading a git warning to notice.
#
# tools/cms_export.py already writes its JSON with newline="\n", so the
# generated data is LF by construction. This covers the hand-edited files.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
